# C. the naming screen - "Enter name of the city".
# B plus twelve B presses to walk the name-entry cursor to the end. This is
# as far as a script gets: finishing the city needs a mouse, and the Deck has
# no working mouse, so the two machines cannot be compared past this point.
wait 250
press start 5
wait 80
press down 5
wait 80
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
press b 5
wait 400
